('3954efcf-50a7-4c7d-b089-44252662f74c'::uuid,'ko','역전할머니맥주 종로3가점','서울 종로구 수표로의 맥주 전문점입니다. 지점 메뉴에는 치즈라볶이, 짜빠구리, 갈릭빠다포테이토, 살얼음파인애플 등의 안주가 소개되어 있습니다.','https://yeokjeonfnc.com/index.html | https://polle.com/place/3TLHDi/%EC%97%AD%EC%A0%84%ED%95%A0%EB%A8%B8%EB%8B%88%EB%A7%A5%EC%A3%BC%201982 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('3954efcf-50a7-4c7d-b089-44252662f74c'::uuid,'en','Yeokjeon Grandma Beer Jongno 3-ga','A Korean beer pub on Supyo-ro in Jongno. Its branch menu lists cheese rabokki, jjapaguri noodles, garlic butter potatoes, and frozen pineapple.','https://yeokjeonfnc.com/index.html | https://polle.com/place/3TLHDi/%EC%97%AD%EC%A0%84%ED%95%A0%EB%A8%B8%EB%8B%88%EB%A7%A5%EC%A3%BC%201982 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('3954efcf-50a7-4c7d-b089-44252662f74c'::uuid,'ja','ヨクジョンハルモニメクチュ 鍾路3街店','ソウル・鍾路区の水標路にあるビアパブ。チーズラポッキ、チャパグリ、ガーリックバターポテト、フローズンパイナップルなどのおつまみがメニューに掲載されています。','https://yeokjeonfnc.com/index.html | https://polle.com/place/3TLHDi/%EC%97%AD%EC%A0%84%ED%95%A0%EB%A8%B8%EB%8B%88%EB%A7%A5%EC%A3%BC%201982 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('3954efcf-50a7-4c7d-b089-44252662f74c'::uuid,'zh-CN','Yeokjeon Grandma Beer 钟路3街店','位于首尔钟路区水标路的韩式啤酒酒馆。公开菜单包括芝士辣炒年糕方便面、韩式双拼拌面、蒜香黄油薯条和冰镇菠萝。','https://yeokjeonfnc.com/index.html | https://polle.com/place/3TLHDi/%EC%97%AD%EC%A0%84%ED%95%A0%EB%A8%B8%EB%8B%88%EB%A7%A5%EC%A3%BC%201982 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('ae7cd325-e248-4962-9f5f-f374071cb940'::uuid,'ko','가봉루','서울 종로구 새문안로5길 당주빌딩 3층에 있는 중식당입니다. 지점별 공개 메뉴에는 잡탕밥, 유산슬밥, 소고기덮밥, 잡채밥 등이 안내되어 있습니다.','https://www.tabling.co.kr/place/677cc7a066de5f06987510c4 | https://polle.com/place/12FgDw/%EA%B0%80%EB%B4%89%EB%A3%A8 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('ae7cd325-e248-4962-9f5f-f374071cb940'::uuid,'en','Gabongru','A Chinese restaurant on the third floor of Dangju Building on Saemunan-ro 5-gil, Jongno. Listed dishes include mixed seafood rice, yusanseul rice, beef rice bowl, and japchae rice.','https://www.tabling.co.kr/place/677cc7a066de5f06987510c4 | https://polle.com/place/12FgDw/%EA%B0%80%EB%B4%89%EB%A3%A8 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('ae7cd325-e248-4962-9f5f-f374071cb940'::uuid,'ja','カボンル','ソウル・鍾路区セムナン路5ギル、堂珠ビル3階の中華料理店。雑炊風あんかけご飯、柳酸絲ご飯、牛肉丼、チャプチェご飯などがメニューにあります。','https://www.tabling.co.kr/place/677cc7a066de5f06987510c4 | https://polle.com/place/12FgDw/%EA%B0%80%EB%B4%89%EB%A3%A8 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('ae7cd325-e248-4962-9f5f-f374071cb940'::uuid,'zh-CN','Gabongru（佳凤楼）','位于首尔钟路区新门内路5街当住大厦三楼的中餐馆。菜单包括杂烩盖饭、溜三丝盖饭、牛肉盖饭和杂菜盖饭。','https://www.tabling.co.kr/place/677cc7a066de5f06987510c4 | https://polle.com/place/12FgDw/%EA%B0%80%EB%B4%89%EB%A3%A8 | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('63390cdd-f899-4d26-93e0-376fcf6a21c5'::uuid,'ko','단막 종각직영점','서울 종로구 종로10길에 있는 막창·고기구이 전문점입니다. 단지 화덕 막창, 파막창, 돼지불막창, 소막창 등의 메뉴를 안내하고 있습니다.','https://polle.com/place/3c2zRa/%EB%8B%A8%EB%A7%89 | https://www.diningcode.com/profile.php?rid=dldRztjhNEWt | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('63390cdd-f899-4d26-93e0-376fcf6a21c5'::uuid,'en','Danmak Jonggak','A grilled makchang and meat restaurant on Jong-ro 10-gil in Seoul. Its listed menu includes clay-oven grilled pork makchang, green-onion makchang, spicy pork makchang, and beef makchang.','https://polle.com/place/3c2zRa/%EB%8B%A8%EB%A7%89 | https://www.diningcode.com/profile.php?rid=dldRztjhNEWt | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('63390cdd-f899-4d26-93e0-376fcf6a21c5'::uuid,'ja','タンマク 鍾閣店','ソウル・鍾路10ギルにあるマクチャン（内臓肉）の炭火焼き料理店。壺窯焼きマクチャン、ねぎマクチャン、辛口豚マクチャン、牛マクチャンなどが掲載されています。','https://polle.com/place/3c2zRa/%EB%8B%A8%EB%A7%89 | https://www.diningcode.com/profile.php?rid=dldRztjhNEWt | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14'),
('63390cdd-f899-4d26-93e0-376fcf6a21c5'::uuid,'zh-CN','Danmak 钟阁店','位于首尔钟路10街的韩式烤肠与烤肉餐厅。公开菜单包括陶罐炉烤猪肠、葱香烤猪肠、辣烤猪肠和烤牛肠。','https://polle.com/place/3c2zRa/%EB%8B%A8%EB%A7%89 | https://www.diningcode.com/profile.php?rid=dldRztjhNEWt | Cross-checked published menu and exact branch on 2026-10-14')
